# --- secrets: never commit a key ---
# The key (and optional workspace id) lives in .env. The store's start script copies it
# into store/config.local.js for the browser; the eval reads .env directly. None of
# those belong in the repo.
.env
.env.*
anthropic_key
**/anthropic_key
config.local.js
**/config.local.js
*.pem
*.key

